{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_c481623cd4d04cf196b4482999f34073","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_df2bf30dee16dcd7910358e7942106b61e5061f6148a3e7191912a0e8c45489c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"math-ai-org/mathcode@6774236e088b snapshot c2426028962b88f5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4b57b2059b31f97d4852722e8bb276a31a80ce4f361b7ddb5d6e794aa5cc34e1","slc_cc6ed3c7ac11bd590675bf1573a7e3385163f9ccf36a0a90770bc5eaffc52fa7"],"source_ids":["src_7cf590cf96925f8fadc2b742381d5170"],"text":"Interactive sessions support a /goal command with positional or --budget token budgets, optional --max-continuations, and pause/resume/status/clear subcommands; it continues the same session rather than spawning a new agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c481623cd4d04cf196b4482999f34073"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_c481623cd4d04cf196b4482999f34073","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e00f2adf9881da73880712b6e5107c82617f8ee0660cee58b9beab456e8b628e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"math-ai-org/mathcode@6774236e088b snapshot c2426028962b88f5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_47f7632c991f1f3855b68f1afe5bd301c6c31d719a87ec1328a426157356a262","slc_5c1672e31963604fd75bc37f5248bd4cde28c6c6600e97469e8bd49b97d7db6f","slc_6472562050c5047f29f755371530787ce0d757e73b146053d0cb45c8e34587de"],"source_ids":["src_7cf590cf96925f8fadc2b742381d5170"],"text":"The CLI ships with recurring prompt scheduling enabled by default; /loop commands create short-lived loops, and durable schedules that survive restarts can be created from interactive sessions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c481623cd4d04cf196b4482999f34073"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_c481623cd4d04cf196b4482999f34073","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e569c24415f791f921d3226ca31f57e0ce32cb343f2d3f03a41a431ea46e80c2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"math-ai-org/mathcode@6774236e088b snapshot c2426028962b88f5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1233a8e9203f2b1daba05b811386e84b2a2bba4913ba9f0db7b725a47196b1ac","slc_a4dc6ee873e339b414384f26624bbd8505a1fbe4e73e0c1168a2791a18b8e7f5"],"source_ids":["src_7cf590cf96925f8fadc2b742381d5170"],"text":"Conversational assumptions can be persisted as axioms per vault via /axiomatize (formalize, list, check consistency, remove); atomic Lean tool calls do not inject them implicitly.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c481623cd4d04cf196b4482999f34073"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_c481623cd4d04cf196b4482999f34073","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f644fc95b618e71a0fd94de2159d1e7e5d0c056e632e90257e989ad8fcfb5cf4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"math-ai-org/mathcode@6774236e088b snapshot c2426028962b88f5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3743fb2dadab51ef6c65cba6799ad09eecc156966bc327024186b6e5df35cd3e"],"source_ids":["src_7cf590cf96925f8fadc2b742381d5170"],"text":"Model effort is set via --effort or /effort with low, medium, high, max, or a positive integer; /effort auto and /effort unset return to the model default.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c481623cd4d04cf196b4482999f34073"}
